### Test Specialization Partial Search API
### This test verifies that the name search now supports partial matching

# Test 1: Partial search with "Gynacologyst" should match "Gynecologist"
curl --location 'http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/specializations?page=1&limit=10&name=Gynacologyst' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhZG1pbmlkIiwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBtYWlsLmNvbSIsInVzZXJUeXBlIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJmaXJzdE5hbWUiOiJBZG1pbiIsImxhc3ROYW1lIjoiVXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc2NDE1ODIwMywiZXhwIjoxNzY0MjQ0NjAzfQ.g7AIhbBV9oquiSlzKF9VmiVJoE9ei7n304V-vTKyIxY' \
--data ''

### Test 2: Partial search with case insensitive search
curl --location 'http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/specializations?page=1&limit=10&name=card' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhZG1pbmlkIiwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBtYWlsLmNvbSIsInVzZXJUeXBlIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJmaXJzdE5hbWUiOiJBZG1pbiIsImxhc3ROYW1lIjoiVXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc2NDE1ODIwMywiZXhwIjoxNzY0MjQ0NjAzfQ.g7AIhbBV9oquiSlzKF9VmiVJoE9ei7n304V-vTKyIxY' \
--data ''

### Test 3: Partial search with date filter
curl --location 'http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/specializations?page=1&limit=10&createdAt=2025-11-12&name=Gynacologyst' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhZG1pbmlkIiwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBtYWlsLmNvbSIsInVzZXJUeXBlIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJmaXJzdE5hbWUiOiJBZG1pbiIsImxhc3ROYW1lIjoiVXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc2NDE1ODIwMywiZXhwIjoxNzY0MjQ0NjAzfQ.g7AIhbBV9oquiSlzKF9VmiVJoE9ei7n304V-vTKyIxY' \
--data ''

### Expected Results:
- Test 1: Should match specializations containing "Gynacologyst" (partial match)
- Test 2: Should match specializations containing "card" (case insensitive)
- Test 3: Should match specializations with partial name AND created date filter